* @title Gimpel PARAGRAPH text reader
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapter 9.3 (PARAGRAPH), built on Chapter 9.1 (READ)
* @input >>>
* First paragraph starts here.
* It has two lines.
* This is sentence three.
*
* Second paragraph here.
* Continues.
*    indented should not start a new paragraph attempt
* Final.
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* <First paragraph starts here.  It has two lines.  This is sentence three.>
* <Second paragraph here.  Continues.>
* skip:    indented should not start a new paragraph attempt
* skip: Final.
* <<<
-INCLUDE "PARAGRAP.INC"
LOOP	P = PARAGRAPH(POS(0) ANY('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'))     :F(NEXT)
	OUTPUT = '<' P '>'                                          :(LOOP)
NEXT	LINE = READ()                                               :F(DONE)
	OUTPUT = 'skip: ' LINE                                      :(NEXT)
DONE
END
